  "Future Cash Next has not started (or is frozen), so its collects and sweeps could not be checked. Start the node, unfreeze it on the Apps tab, and try again.",
  "{n} Future Cash Next collects or sweeps are still under way, which only this wallet's keys can finish: {ids}",
  "rescue ON → {where}",
  "The guardian is watching your stakes while this app runs.",
  "Watching your stakes while this app runs, even with its window closed. Anything maturing onto a reused key is collected and swept to safety within about a block.",
  "It needs somewhere to move rescued funds before it can run. Start guardian will ask: a fresh address on this node takes one click.",
  "Off. After a stake matures, anyone can collect it (that needs no signature), which lands the money on its payout address. If that address's key was reused, it sits there exposed until you act. With the guardian on, it is moved to safety within about a block of landing.",
  "Background signing",
  "allowed for this wallet",
  "not allowed",
  "Take back background signing",
  "destination: {where}",
  "Coins held: {n}. Sweep them off first.",
  "Retired here",
