  "Scans this node. Collections return to the original payout address.",
  "1. Start the node.\n2. Start the guardian on the Guardian tab and choose a rescue destination.\n3. Stakes tab: enter an amount, pick when it unlocks, press Lock it.\n4. Enable auto-collect for safe matured stakes, or collect them yourself when ready.\n\nThe guardian rescues at-risk stakes to the configured destination.",
  "Safe collection requires a complete audit. A result stays fresh for 30 minutes. After that, the app re-checks this node's key set and counters; an unchanged result can be used for up to 24 hours. Changed or unavailable keys pause safe collection. Local checks cannot detect new reuse by another copy of your seed; fresh online audits are still needed.",
  "In order of likelihood:\n① The node is not running.\n② The guardian isn't started.\n③ At-risk stake: rescue isn't set up, or your vault is locked.\n④ Your safe destination was flagged REUSED: set a fresh one.\n⑤ Auto-collect is off: use Collect on the stake itself.\n\nNothing is lost by waiting: matured coins stay locked to your payout address until collected.",
  "The node is not running. Start it on the Node tab. Until then nothing can be collected or rescued.",
  "Take back background signing?",
  "Future Cash Next then signs nothing by itself, and the guardian stops. You can still collect and sweep by hand.",
  "Take back",
  "Every matured stake on a clean address is collected to its own payout address.",
  "Collection requests posted: {n}. They confirm in about a block.",
  "Recover coins",
  "The coins on retired addresses are moved to your rescue destination, one signature each, with each address's own key.",
  "Recover",
  "Every coin on this address is moved to your rescue destination, one signature each:\n{address}",
  "This address is taken out of the node's change rotation for good and kept watch-only. It moves no funds:\n{address}",
  "Nothing is signed by itself. The guardian stays off.",
  "Lock {amount} MINIMA for {blocks} blocks (about {when}), payable only to:\n{to}\n\nNobody, not even you, can unlock it early.",
  "a fresh address of this node",
  "Future Cash Next has not started yet.",
  "Could not read the complete stake list. Refresh and retry.",
  "Only an address the key audit found at risk is retired here.",
  "Start the guardian first: a retired address can still be paid, and only the running guardian moves what arrives there to your safe address.",
  "This stake is already being collected.",
  "Background signing is not allowed on this computer.",
  "Couldn't read Minima Core's reply to {verb}: it may have succeeded. Check the Activity log before retrying.",
  "Minima Core didn't respond (at {verb})",
